Generic single-database configuration for Alembic.

The database URL is injected at runtime from app.config.settings (see env.py),
so `sqlalchemy.url` is intentionally left blank in alembic.ini.

Common commands (run from the /api directory):

    alembic upgrade head          # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1          # roll back one migration
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"   # generate a new migration
